{
  "id": "PSA.61",
  "number": "61",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 61",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 9,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "61",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 61"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "61",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au chef de musique. Sur Neguinoth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". De David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.61.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.61.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! écoute mon cri, sois attentif à ma prière.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Du bout de la terre je crierai à toi, dans l'accablement de mon cœur ; tu me conduiras sur un rocher qui est trop haut pour moi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car tu m'as été un refuge, une forte tour, de devant l'ennemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je séjournerai dans ta tente à toujours ; je me réfugierai sous l'abri de tes ailes. Sélah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car toi, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.61.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.61.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! tu as entendu mes vœux, tu m'as donné l'héritage de ceux qui craignent ton nom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu ajouteras des jours aux jours du roi ; ses années seront comme des générations et des générations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il habitera pour toujours devant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.61.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.61.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Donne la bonté et la vérité, afin qu'elles le gardent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 61:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainsi je chanterai ton nom à perpétuité, acquittant mes vœux jour par jour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.61.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.61.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.62",
    "number": "62",
